<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Roche.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Roche.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued two million American-style call warrants on Roche Holding GS, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    15,000 CHF		PREMIUM	24.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     7.00 CHF		  GEARING	18.0 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.MAR.97-28.OCT.98   PAYDATE	12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  12,600 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
